Contact: Laura Chen, Media Relations, 555-0193

NORTHFIELD (May 4) — Greenway Grocers today announced a partnership with Bluepeak Logistics, a regional delivery company. The agreement between the two companies {{1}} Greenway to offer same-day grocery delivery in five new cities starting June 1. Until now, customers in these cities have had to wait up to three days for their orders. Greenway expects demand for the faster service to be high. {{2}}, Bluepeak plans to hire 150 additional drivers before the launch. "This partnership will help us {{3}} the needs of busy families who have little time to shop," said Greenway CEO Mark Ellison. {{4}}
